<main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-8 lg:px-8"><div class="mb-8 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-white/85 p-8 shadow-soft sm:p-12"><p class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-mint px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.18em]">Staff dashboard</p><h1 class="mt-4 font-headline text-5xl font-extrabold sm:text-6xl">Business operations</h1><p class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-softText">Manage daily inventory and customer order fulfillment. Financial records are restricted to the owner/admin.</p></div>
